# ask-avia line endings.
#
# Editing happens on the Dev PC (Windows), running happens on the workstation, and
# Tool Standard point 5 puts this in a Linux container unchanged. Normalise to LF in
# the repository so a checkout on Linux does not carry CRLF into shell scripts, where
# it fails with an error message that names the wrong thing.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only files keep CRLF on checkout.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary. Never normalise, never diff as text.
*.duckdb binary
*.parquet binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
